  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for participation of representatives from developing countries at 2022 UN Ocean Conference, Lisbon. Ireland&#x2019;s contribution will be earmarked to representatives from Small Island Developing States, which face extreme levels of climate risk and are a key stakeholder in ocean conservation. The overarching theme of the 2022 UN Ocean Conference is &#x201c;Scaling up ocean action based on science and innovation for the implementation of Goal 14: stocktaking, partnerships and solutions&#x201d;.</narrative>
  </description>
